      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "押什么，最迟今天午前定。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-16"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "B26-16",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "今天午前不去，就进不去了。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-16"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "B26-20",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "本班本支路实到六十壶",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-20"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "B26-26",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "这些箱子是哪个柜上的",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-26"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "B26-27",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "日期和两个字——往北——",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-27"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "B26-28",
      "chapter": 260,
      "quote": "次批那份名单，前些天就摆在值桌上了",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-28"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "B26-31",
      "chapter": 252,
      "quote": "她轻轻合上圈页，页脚留出半指宽的缝。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": false,
      "status": "superseded_by_round2",
      "closure_id": "B26-31"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 251,
      "quote": "量完五层，林渡和沈家儿子沿检修坡上六层，裴七拄着杖落在后面。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 251,
      "quote": "“抬的人一前一后，只踩嵌进墙里的板边，不能在外沿并排。”林渡把绳沿墙铺直，“托板顺着窄台走，到了转角先停。直着转不过去，就退回来另找落板的地方，不能把躺着的人翻侧过去。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "B26-04",
      "chapter": 252,
      "quote": "人已核、身份片登记仍待柜上核的一户",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-04"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "阿九拿过来捋了一遍，把两处霉软的绳段剪出，丢进退料筐，余下的分段摊开：“够绑板，不够留备绳。每一道单独兜底，不接那两段软的。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "“短了，绳头就多。”林渡说。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "余下的好绳分作三道兜底，绳头各收在托板侧边，比先前试的样板多出一指。阿九把绕法画在板背，哪一股松了就停用，不能指望旁边两道替它撑完全程。备用的绳，一根也没有。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "压第二遍，绳结没有再移。他让修管班那个壮实的人坐到板中，前后两头只提离地一寸，停住，再放回料桶。绳头还在原记号上。这才算平地试过，转角仍得空板先走。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "B26-09",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "下半天靠海这面先晒热，背阴面却还留着潮气。几根退下来的板，裂口都起在干湿交界处；透过缝的光只把裂口照了出来，缝已经在了。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-09"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "B26-09",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "夜里凉回来，也得重新验，裂了的木纹不会长回去。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-09"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "id": "B26-07",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "垫料堆里那七根板",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-07"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "id": "B26-07",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "拆栏一截，出板十根，初筛留四退六，试压再废一根，现存好料三根、垫料七根；",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-07"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "id": "B26-07",
      "chapter": 254,
      "quote": "杜姨念完，在“好料三根”下补了一行：一副可试运，半副待补。坏料抽走了，绳也卸下另放，不能把半副拿去抬人。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-07"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "id": "B26-10",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "他怀里抱着昨天验过的完整托板。另半副仍在料场等补，今天先用这一副。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-10"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "“拐不过就停，病人不能跟板翻侧。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "id": "B26-19",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "“你们轮着抬前后两头。”林渡说，“窄台上只准一前一后。沈家儿子伤了虎口，我左肩也使不上力，我们在门内接人、看板，不能算两双好手。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-19"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "id": "B26-10",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "这是昨天平地试过的那一副，两根木纹还直，没有新的起丝；坏掉那根已经另退。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-10"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "id": "B26-12",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "绳头交到邵萍手里，松握着，不缠手腕。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": false,
      "status": "superseded_by_round2",
      "closure_id": "B26-12"
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "两名修管工一前一后抬着，余下的人留在门内。走到第五步，前头的人喊了一声“转角”，先矮下身去。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "id": "B26-01",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "今天在日头底下看得比量路那天更清楚",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-01"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "前头的抬者为了让过墙角，把肩往下压，托板一头低半尺",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "林渡守在原屋门槛内，视线沿托板落到老人的肩膀上。前端已经低下去，后端还没能转过墙角。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "两名抬者停住，前面那人一只脚已被逼到靠海外沿。林渡看见板边往下沉，立刻把身后的门内让空。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "退比进慢。两名抬者一步一步退到门里，等候的人伸手接住两头",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "空托板先试了两次。前端先送入空门，接手的修管工站在屋内；后端向前送，等整副板进屋才调头。这样脚始终留在墙侧，不再为拐角踩向裂撑上方。空板没有磕墙，才把老人接来。两名抬者走到门前，屋内的人接住前端，等后端也进门才一起放平。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "“先在这儿停。”他说，“等凉下来查清楚，伤到绳股就不走。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "id": "B26-10",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "“只有半副，不能用。”阿九说，“补料还得再拆；今天这副验不过，就在屋里等。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-10"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "id": "B26-11",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "抬者把托板放稳，轮流退到空屋门内歇肩。老人就留在这处歇点，邵萍守在她身边",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-11"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "id": "B26-11",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "她家的原屋里还留着两张床、一口缸、父亲上工带的家伙",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-11"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "id": "B26-13",
      "chapter": 255,
      "quote": "邵萍把歇点的门掩住，隔着窄台看了一眼自家的门牌。那半格还没填，已经有人来问屋子了。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-13"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "id": "B26-11",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "旬头那夜，众人在六层空屋等到汽退。黑潮过半，才重新抬起邵萍母亲的托板，走第二段。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-11"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "空屋里换了两名修管工，前后各一人抬。两头先提到齐槛高，再一道向前送；过了窄处，到坡面较宽的地方，另外两人才上手分力。老人眼睛闭着，没有再攥带子。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "id": "B26-11",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "出发前，阿九已在空屋内复验过那副托板。走到坡上时，",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-11"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "id": "B26-08",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "原先磨起的是表面浮毛，里面绳股没有割断；阿九将接触墙角的结转到板侧，受磨处留在眼下能看见的位置。老人还在平地上时，两名抬者就地提起、停住再放回，绳结没有走，才许出门。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-08"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "id": "B26-14",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "林渡跟丁字三一道上坡去看了一趟。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-14"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "id": "B26-15",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "“核心内廊”这几个字",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-15"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "id": "B26-16",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "“明天只有午前。”丁字三把纸收起来，“午后一过，这一页就得等下一旬。”",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-16"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "id": "B26-13",
      "chapter": 256,
      "quote": "半印露在折边外，缺的那个角仍看得见。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-13"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "id": "B26-19",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "棚里出他和沈家儿子，在门内接扶、看路；窄台上的承重仍由修管班轮换。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-19"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "id": "B26-10",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "阿九修拆栏后剩的那半副：",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-10"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "id": "B26-17",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "今天这几处岗位一个也抽不出来",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": false,
      "status": "superseded_by_round2",
      "closure_id": "B26-17"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "id": "B26-13",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "就由我自己保管。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-13"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "id": "B26-19",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "用右手扶住送到门内的木板，左肩不顶重物。扶了两趟，右臂也酸了，他叫人先把板落稳再调头。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-19"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "id": "B26-17",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "今天一趟送人、一趟搬家什，分开的两路都签了回来；原定四趟家什只做完一趟，余下的仍压在后面。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-17"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "id": "B26-13",
      "chapter": 257,
      "quote": "她的圈随布袋带走了。账桌上留下门房的纸条，“过了午不放”仍露在石子外。此刻早过了午，今天搬下来的人有人照护，那道门却不会为他们补开半天。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-13"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "id": "B26-17",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "等明天头一起汽退。邵萍母亲旬头夜里先到，昨日和今晨趁能走时又接下三名老人；四个孩子由家人牵着同行，各人的到棚时辰都另落在名单上。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-17"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "id": "B26-21",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "这条规矩取的正是邵萍家今晨的做法。她父亲后半夜下工，天亮没睡",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-21"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "id": "B26-21",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "午后对面楼那家的男人照着新规做。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-21"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "id": "B26-31",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "，没有在销账栏落笔。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-31"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "id": "B26-23",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "第一批已迁各行要送上柜上复押一次。名册和空置页各有棚留底与柜封存本，这次送去的是柜上那两份；第五名卧床者仍标未迁。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-23"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "id": "B26-22",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "他在檐下闻到一阵淡蜡味，随内廊吹来的风时有时无。深处是灯还是封蜡，门外看不清；他只把脚留在石边上，等下一阵轮声。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-22"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "id": "B26-21",
      "chapter": 258,
      "quote": "头一阵过去后，两人又在檐下等了许久，阿九几次向坡口问时。直到交班人报到寅头，第二阵轮声才歇下去，廊子里的光也收回去",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-21"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "id": "B26-25",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "抬第五个人的事排在头一起汽退后。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-25"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "id": "B26-03",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "第一批九口，前四个卧床的老人已经下来了，灰白身份片那户的邵萍母亲是头一个。剩下的是名单上第五位老人；他的身份核记已经齐了，只差到棚这一格。家里仍留人用六层门禁片，门外木牌也没有取下。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-03"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "id": "B26-25",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "走法沿用抬邵萍母亲时试出的两段接力。窄台六步到转角，先将托板送进内侧空屋，换向后再出门走十来步，才到坡上歇台；不能在窄台上落板。第二段从歇台到五层，路长、坡缓，接班的人先在那里等。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-25"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "id": "B26-19",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "林渡只在门内用右手扶正板尾，左肩避开横杠；出门前便交回修管工。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": false,
      "status": "superseded_by_round2",
      "closure_id": "B26-19"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "id": "B26-12",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "绳头松握在人手里，不缠手腕。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-12"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "id": "B26-02",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "两名抬者一前一后沿墙侧移步，前端先送进空屋。屋里的人接住后端，等整副托板落平才换向。没有人踩到裂撑上方的外沿，老人只在进门时捏紧了鞋袋，身子没有下滑。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": false,
      "status": "superseded_by_round2",
      "closure_id": "B26-02"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "id": "B26-25",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "托板从空屋重新抬出，绕过转角后，再往前走十来步，才到歇台。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
      "present_unchanged_in_final": true,
      "status": "retained",
      "closure_id": "B26-25"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "id": "B26-19",
      "chapter": 259,
      "quote": "第二段换人。沈家儿子从门内扶接过来，掌上包布已湿，阿九叫他松手休息。等在歇台的棚里年轻女人接过扶接的位置，承重的修管工换另外两个；林渡沿墙边看前路，不再抬板尾。",
      "present_in_reviewed_round1": true,
